+## Key Insights
+- ast-grep as Parser: SupportLang::from_path + AstGrep::new + Node API (is_named/
+  kind/range/children). One dep = rust/ts/tsx/js/go. The CstF walk stays inside
+  ast-grep's Node API (no raw tree-sitter). API verified at ast-grep-core 0.38.7
